  "translation": "Na Yarobeam yɛɛ afahyɛ wɔ ɔsram a ɛtɔ so nwɔtwe no mu, wɔ da a ɛtɔ so dunum wɔ ɔsram no mu, sɛdeɛ afahyɛ a ɛwɔ Yuda no teɛ; na ɔkɔɔ soro kodu bɔfedw no so. Saa ara na ɔyɛe wɔ Bet-El, de bɔɔ nantwie nkumaa a ɔyɛe no afɔre, na ɔsiw ⟨את⟩ abunnɛ asɔfoɔ a ɔyɛe no gui wɔ Bet-El.",
